- Lint / static-check each module; run any migrated tests.
- Start every MCP server and list its tools (`claude mcp list` / MCP inspector); call one read-only tool per group with dry-run config.
- Complete the checklist in `docs/VERIFICATION_REPORT.md`: every capability group wired · no secrets committed · provenance headers present · overlaps resolved · gaps documented in `GAPS.md`.
